              "paragraphId": "p0439",
              "numbering": "Section 10.14",
              "text": "Section 10.14 Insurance. Each of the Servicer and the Marketing Agent will maintain, at its own expense, throughout the term of this Agreement and for one (1) year thereafter: (a) commercial general liability insurance of not less than $1,000,000 per occurrence and $2,000,000 in the aggregate; (b) professional liability (errors and omissions) insurance of not less than $2,000,000; (c) for so long as it holds, processes or has access to Personally Identifiable Information of Obligors, cyber liability insurance of not less than $5,000,000; and (d) workers' compensation insurance as required by applicable Law. Each of the Servicer and the Marketing Agent will deliver certificates of insurance evidencing such coverage to the Issuer, the Depositor and the Indenture Trustee on request."
